  "summary": "Senior Software Engineer and Full-Stack Developer with extensive experience designing, developing, testing, deploying, modernizing, and supporting enterprise-scale applications in high-volume production environments.\n\nMy background includes Java 8/JEE, Spring Boot, microservices, REST and SOAP APIs, distributed systems, JMS, SQL, Oracle, GitHub, Jenkins, CI/CD, XML, and JSON.\n\nA recent focus has been FedEx Project CONDOR, a major multi-wave data center migration and cloud modernization initiative. Working on the GURU  application umbrella, I personally rewrote legacy source code, created CI/CD pipelines to build and deploy projects, participated in cloud-server and database design decisions, and troubleshot both migration and production issues. Our two-person team supported more than 15 applications, using Java 8, Spring Boot, GitHub, and the PCF cloud platform.\n\nI enjoy solving complex technical problems and turning business and migration requirements into maintainable, reliable software. My experience includes application modernization, technical design, API development, production support, code reviews, documentation, automated testing, and mentoring.\n\nI also hold a Google AI Professional Certificate completed in 2026 and am building AI-assisted development into my modern engineering toolkit.",
